00:58:14.370 --> 00:58:18.720
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia. I'm Ira Glass.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责。我是艾拉·格拉斯。

00:58:18.720 --> 00:58:22.230
<v Michael Lewis>[SINGING] It's your thing. I can't do that. You ruined my life.
<v Michael Lewis>[唱歌] 这是你的事。我做不到。你毁了我的生活。

00:58:22.230 --> 00:58:27.230
<v Ira Glass>Yeah, are we ruining yours? Are we? Well, either way, we're going to be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>是的，我们在毁掉你的吗？是我们吗？好吧，无论如何，我们下周将回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。
